HTTPTunnelPort 127.0.0.1:8118
DNSPort 127.0.0.1:53530

ControlPort 127.0.0.1:9051
CookieAuthentication 1
SocksPolicy accept 127.0.0.1
SocksPolicy reject *

GeoIPFile data/geoip
GeoIPv6File data/geoipv6

CircuitPadding 0
ConnectionPadding 0
UseMicrodescriptors 1

DormantOnFirstStartup 0
DormantCanceledByStartup 1
LearnCircuitBuildTimeout 0
CircuitBuildTimeout 20
MaxCircuitDirtiness 86400
NumEntryGuards 15
NumDirectoryGuards 6
MaxClientCircuitsPending 128
SocksTimeout 120
KeepalivePeriod 3600

ClientBootstrapConsensusAuthorityDownloadInitialDelay 0
ClientBootstrapConsensusFallbackDownloadInitialDelay 0
ClientBootstrapConsensusAuthorityOnlyDownloadInitialDelay 0
ClientBootstrapConsensusMaxInProgressTries 6

FetchDirInfoEarly 1
FetchDirInfoExtraEarly 1

PathsNeededToBuildCircuits 0.25

ClientTransportPlugin webtunnel exec webtunnel.exe
ClientTransportPlugin obfs4 exec obfs4proxy.exe
ClientTransportPlugin snowflake exec snowflake-client.exe

DataDirectory data
Log notice file data/tor.log
DisableDebuggerAttachment 1
AvoidDiskWrites 1
SafeLogging 1

ConfluxEnabled 1
ConfluxClientUX throughput

ConfluxNumSets 32
ConfluxNumLinkedSets 32
ConfluxNumLegs 2
ConfluxSetSelection 3
